          "en": "(1) The Government may determine Goods Trade under supervision.\n(2) In the event of the determination of Goods under supervision as referred to in paragraph (1), the Government may receive input from business organisations.\n(3) Goods under supervision as referred to in\nparagraph (1) shall be determined by Presidential Regulation.\n\nParagraph (1) Sufficiently clear.\nParagraph (2) The term “business organisation” means an organisation regulated by law.\nParagraph (3) Sufficiently clear."
